    <briefdescription>
<para>Models a rocket nozzle. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><heading level="3">Configuration File Format:</heading>
</para>
<para><programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">&lt;nozzle<sp/>name=</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;{string}&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">&gt;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>&lt;pe<sp/>unit=</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;{PSF}&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">&gt;<sp/>{number}<sp/><sp/>&lt;/pe&gt;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>&lt;area<sp/>unit=</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;{FT2<sp/>|<sp/>M2<sp/>|<sp/>IN2}&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">&gt;<sp/>{number}<sp/><sp/>&lt;/area&gt;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">&lt;/nozzle&gt;</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
<para><heading level="3">Configuration parameters are:</heading>
</para>
<para><preformatted>
    <bold>pe</bold> -      Nozzle design exit pressure.
    <bold>area</bold> -    Nozzle area at the exit plane.
</preformatted></para>
<para>All parameters MUST be specified. <linebreak/>
 <simplesect kind="author"><para>Jon S. Berndt </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
